# Copy to `.env` (or set in your host's build settings) only when the site and
# the live-map WebSocket server are deployed to DIFFERENT origins —
# e.g. the static site on Netlify and the Node server on Render.
#
# It is read at BUILD time by Vite, so it must be set before `npm run build`.
# Leave it unset when one server serves both (same origin), as with render.yaml.
#
# Use wss:// (secure) for an https site, and include the /ws path:
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-server.onrender.com/ws
